  "prompt": "Bold stylized illustration of an androgynous ]skate boarder holding onto a kite in exaggerated extreme perspective, with dramatically oversized legs and sneakers dominating the foreground, feet pushed closest to the viewer for strong foreshortening. The body twists dynamically above the enlarged lower half. Outfit in deep cobalt with warm orange and acid green accents. Background in vivid raspberry red with bold graphic arcs and curved motion lines. Flat graphic color blocks remain strong and high-contrast, but add subtle tonal variation, soft shadow transitions, and a delicate speckled grain overlay across large color areas to avoid a clean vector appearance. Slightly imperfect, hand-drawn outlines and gentle color noise give a printed poster feel. Energetic, confident, contemporary street-sport aesthetic with tactile depth. --ar 2:3 --sref 2290254795 --profile zaqosmx --hd --v 8.1",
